Bundled map assets (mapcore/src/main/assets/mapcore/)
-----------------------------------------------------
These data files are NOT covered by the AGPL-3.0 above; they keep the licenses
of their upstream projects:

* Fonts — fonts/Noto Sans {Regular,Medium,Italic}/*.pbf
  Noto Sans, rendered to signed-distance-field glyph PBFs.
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
  https://github.com/notofonts/noto-fonts

* Map style and sprites — style-dark.json, style-light.json, sprites/*
  Derived from the Protomaps basemap style and sprite sheet.
  BSD 3-Clause / MIT (Protomaps styles are published under a permissive license).
  https://github.com/protomaps/basemaps

* Map data (rendered at runtime from the .pmtiles the host app installs)
  © OpenStreetMap contributors.
  Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  The style's own "attribution" field already carries
  "© OpenStreetMap contributors"; any UI showing this map must keep that
  attribution visible.

